subtractUnderflow path subtractUnderflow
subtractUnderflow imports standard.math
subtractUnderflow exports main

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect none
main uses none
main memoryHeap false
main async false
